    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overview</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a Greek Nymph on a divine journey to heal and reconcile with Hera. Travel ancient Greece in a first person narratively driven journey, as you find Echo's friends and family to find the pieces of her entrusted to them. Discover her past and work towards her future. Be sure to avoid detection of those who would bar your path. Overcome the puzzles along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362760/extras/2f7b368af466a8b098fcde7c0224fb24.poster.avif?t=1747893181\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362760/extras/2f7b368af466a8b098fcde7c0224fb24.webm?t=1747893181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362760/extras/2f7b368af466a8b098fcde7c0224fb24.mp4?t=1747893181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caduceus</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Locating Echo the Caduceus is your lifeline. It will paint the world with color for you to navigate by where sounds occur. Different colors indicate different sources of sound, so be careful when you see the color of footsteps before you that you might have missed. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overview</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a Greek Nymph on a divine journey to heal and reconcile with Hera. Travel ancient Greece in a first person narratively driven journey, as you find Echo's friends and family to find the pieces of her entrusted to them. Discover her past and work towards her future. Be sure to avoid detection of those who would bar your path. Overcome the puzzles along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362760/extras/2f7b368af466a8b098fcde7c0224fb24.poster.avif?t=1747893181\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362760/extras/2f7b368af466a8b098fcde7c0224fb24.webm?t=1747893181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362760/extras/2f7b368af466a8b098fcde7c0224fb24.mp4?t=1747893181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caduceus</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Locating Echo the Caduceus is your lifeline. It will paint the world with color for you to navigate by where sounds occur. Different colors indicate different sources of sound, so be careful when you see the color of footsteps before you that you might have missed. </p>",
    "short_description": "Locating Echo is a narratively driven first person walking sim. Explore a world painted by sound, avoid getting caught, and solve puzzles to uncover Echo's past, heal, and ultimately retrieve her voice.",
